      "id": "tea_break_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "じゃあ、少しだけお茶の時間にしよっか。急いで飲むやつじゃなくて、手を温めるためのやつ。",
      "translatedText": "Then let's take a small tea break. Not the rushed kind. The kind where you warm your hands first.",
