    {
      "id": "tea_break_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "一口ぶんだけ休んだら、次の一歩を小さくしよう。大きくしすぎると、また机の上で迷子になるから。",
      "translatedText": "After one sip's worth of rest, let's make the next step small. If we make it too big, it will get lost on the desk again.",
